# Reviewed SF-13 PDP rollout evidence gate arguments.
# Point the evidence directory at the reviewed artifact root. Review only
# payload-free rollout summaries. Keep proof payloads, bearer tokens, signing
# keys, raw challenge material, and operator secrets in runtime-only locations.
--evidence-dir /var/tmp/sorafs/pdp-rollout
--summary-out /var/tmp/sorafs/pdp-rollout-summary.json
--max-evidence-age-secs 604800
--max-route-latency-ms 1500
--max-proof-latency-ms 90000
--min-providers 3
--min-challenges 3
--min-proofs 3
